# desc: 실에 위치한 포인트를 가진 장비는 무엇이며 그 실은 어디인가? — 장비·포인트·위치를 잇는 실제 공유 경로
# suite: core
# shared: true
# monotone: up
# expect-min: 1
PREFIX brick: <https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#>
PREFIX rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?equipment ?point ?room
WHERE {
  ?equipment a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Equipment .
  ?equipment brick:hasPoint|^brick:isPointOf ?point .
  ?room brick:isLocationOf|^brick:hasLocation ?point .
  ?room a/rdfs:subClassOf* brick:Room .
}
ORDER BY ?equipment ?point ?room
